The forward lens builds a field (extra, line 9 of 1.0) that schema 1.0 doesn't
declare, though the schema is open. checkLensResults finds it in Go.

The error is positioned at the whole lens result (here, the lens on line 7),
not at the field: UndeclaredLensFields returns paths, and cuetil's syntax Tree
has no positions (see TestViewsOfAuthoredValues). Looking up the lens value at
each path would find the field's position. The Translate-time counterpart,
checkLensResultFields, returns errors with no position, but isn't reached here:
bind rejects the lens first.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count?: int
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count: int & <10
	...
}

forward: {
	count: from.count
	extra: 1
}

backward: {
	count: to.count
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
schema: {
	title: string
	count: int & <10
	...
}

forward: {
	count: from.count
	extra: 1
}

backward: {
	count: to.count
}
-- out/error --
the result of lens 0.0->1.0 writes extra, which schema 1.0 does not declare:
    ship/history/1.0.thema:7:1
-- out/positions --
the result of lens 0.0->1.0 writes extra, which schema 1.0 does not declare
	authored ship/history/1.0.thema:7:1
